      {
        "title": "Priority order",
        "content": "1. `api.ts` `request()` — auth/error core, currently fully untested.\n2. `utils/transcript.ts` `buildConversationItems` — most complex pure function, zero coverage, drives the transcript UI.\n3. `utils/errors.ts` — many branches, easy wins.\n4. Hooks (`useToasts`, `useKeyboardShortcuts`) — stateful, regression-prone (stale closures).\n5. `utils/cache.ts` / `utils/config.ts` — smaller but currently 0%.",
